<title>USA: Scitex loses Graphic Arts Group president.</title>
<headline>Scitex loses Graphic Arts Group president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scitex Corp Ltd said on Monday that Shimon Alon, senior executive vice president and president of the Graphic Arts Group, has decided to leave Scitex to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Scitex President and Chief Executive Yoav Z. Chelouche said he will be in charge of the Graphic Arts Group until further notice.</p>
<p>A statement from the company made no mention of a successor to Alon and a company spokesman could not be reached.</p>
</text>
